Upstream files and adapted functions:
- R/AutoGeneratedDefinitions.R: getConceptSetDefinition.
  Its header says "This file is part of FeatureExtraction"; this is retained
  as an upstream attribution in the source comments.
- R/GetPostDeleteDefinition.R: getDefinition.
- R/Private.R: .checkBaseUrl, .getStandardCategories,
  .millisecondsToDate, .convertToDateTime.
- R/WebApi.R: getWebApiVersion.
- R/httrWrappers.R: .GET, .request.

Modifications for studyGenerics:
- Keep the helpers internal and support only concept-set retrieval.
- Check optional dependencies through studyGenerics:::requireInstall().
- Pass authentication explicitly per request instead of caching headers in
  ROhdsiWebApi's environment. Accept ATLAS_TOKEN with or without Bearer.
- Authenticate version checks, require HTTPS for tokens, disable redirects,
  and limit each HTTP request to 30 seconds.
- Validate inputs and responses; handle HTTP failures without fetching the
  metadata of unrelated definitions. Retain expression and date conversion.

